dir TB
node Start stadium "開始"
node Input parallelogram "ユーザー入力"
node Process rect "リクエスト検証" in Core
node Auth rhombus "認証チェック" in Core
node DB cylinder "データベース照会" in Core
node Err rect "エラー生成" in Core
node Calc rect "データ加工" in Core
node Response parallelogram "レスポンス返却"
node Finish stadium "終了"
link Start -> Input solid none/arrow len=1
link Input -> Process solid none/arrow len=1
link Process -> Auth solid none/arrow len=1
link Auth -> DB solid none/arrow len=1 "成功"
link Auth -> Err solid none/arrow len=1 "失敗"
link DB -> Calc solid none/arrow len=1
link Calc -> Response solid none/arrow len=1
link Err -> Response solid none/arrow len=1
link Response -> Finish solid none/arrow len=1
subgraph Core "バックエンド処理" [Process Auth DB Err Calc]
